1
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,600
Hae-in!

2
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:58,500
THE OPENING

3
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:15,800
I heard the worker who found it
is your father.

4
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:24,800
...I don't know him.

5
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:36,800
"Found by: a construction worker,
name unknown"

6
00:01:37,300 --> 00:01:40,700
"Final survey.
Permanent closure to follow."

7
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:44,500
Kim Dong-su

8
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:12,500
Three years.

9
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:18,600
Tomorrow it closes for good.
Come with me.

10
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:57,200
Don't touch it.

11
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:08,800
...I think I've seen this place.
In a dream.

12
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:31,000
It has... no eyes?

13
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:36,300
Down here, it must find its way
by something else.

14
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:05,800
It's yours, isn't it?
With this, I can put your name in.

15
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:08,300
Don't.

16
00:04:11,500 --> 00:04:15,500
That didn't come off my hand.

17
00:04:38,300 --> 00:04:41,700
You found it.
A seven-year-old.

18
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:46,600
After that, you didn't speak
for a year.

19
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:11,400
Why didn't you tell me?
For twenty years.

20
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:18,200
The day you spoke again...
I thought, that's enough.

21
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:22,600
That day, I saw you at the back door.

22
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:26,600
I saw you...
and I said I didn't know you.

23
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:30,200
I shouldn't have gone.

24
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:32,600
No.

25
00:05:47,500 --> 00:05:49,500
Leave it blank.

26
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,800
Then this gentleman is...

27
00:05:54,500 --> 00:05:56,700
He's my father.

28
00:06:06,300 --> 00:06:08,800
Dad. Stay for dinner.

